WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.952 --> 00:00:04.269
- Depending on what it
is, yes I like animals.

00:00:04.269 --> 00:00:06.063
- Yeah, I love animals.

00:00:06.063 --> 00:00:07.038
They're better than us.

00:00:07.038 --> 00:00:10.455
- Bein' around 'em and
pettin' em if they're fuzzy.

00:00:10.455 --> 00:00:11.470
- Dream pet list.

00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:12.303
Dog, goat,

00:00:13.178 --> 00:00:14.312
yak.

00:00:14.312 --> 00:00:16.537
I mean, I'm almost 30,
I think anything more is

00:00:16.537 --> 00:00:20.253
gonna put me in the crazy,
(laughs) the crazy bin.

00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:23.336
(happy guitar music)

00:00:24.838 --> 00:00:27.525
Whatever's in that cage is
big and loud, and it's moving,

00:00:27.525 --> 00:00:30.442
and I'm a little freaked out by it.

00:00:33.329 --> 00:00:34.620
- Sure.

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:37.037
- I'm ready to meet my buddy.

00:00:38.449 --> 00:00:41.013
- Made a little noise.

00:00:41.013 --> 00:00:42.029
- Is that a skunk?

00:00:42.029 --> 00:00:43.946
(beep)

00:00:50.359 --> 00:00:51.192
- Woah.

00:00:53.243 --> 00:00:54.426
Oh my God.

00:00:54.426 --> 00:00:55.259
- What?

00:00:56.946 --> 00:00:58.363
- Oh ho ho, what?

00:01:00.277 --> 00:01:01.110
Aww, hi.

00:01:03.205 --> 00:01:05.035
- Hello, here's a leaf.

00:01:05.035 --> 00:01:06.175
Oh, you wanna eat that leaf?

00:01:06.175 --> 00:01:07.759
You don't wanna eat the
leaf I'm giving you?

00:01:07.759 --> 00:01:09.176
It's pretty rude.

00:01:12.081 --> 00:01:15.255
- This is the coolest thing
that's ever happened to me.

00:01:15.255 --> 00:01:16.323
Oh, there's two!

00:01:16.323 --> 00:01:17.573
There's a baby.

00:01:19.389 --> 00:01:21.222
- My God, it's a baby!

00:01:22.395 --> 00:01:24.471
Here you go, little baby.

00:01:24.471 --> 00:01:26.792
- Two (gasps)?

00:01:26.792 --> 00:01:27.698
Oh my--

00:01:27.698 --> 00:01:28.531
- Oh!

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:32.780
Okay.

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:34.231
This is cool.

00:01:34.231 --> 00:01:35.941
I'm good, I'm gonna stand.

00:01:35.941 --> 00:01:38.260
- Oh, can I touch 'em?

00:01:38.260 --> 00:01:40.012
- What's the touching situation
here, 'cause I feel like

00:01:40.012 --> 00:01:44.179
it could go bad real quick (laughs).

00:01:45.605 --> 00:01:46.438
- Oh.

00:01:48.003 --> 00:01:49.670
- These are so cool.

00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:53.308
(laughs)

00:01:53.308 --> 00:01:55.005
- Oop, oop, it got me.

00:01:55.005 --> 00:01:58.449
It didn't hurt at all,
it just was like eh.

00:01:58.449 --> 00:02:00.078
- I thought it was a skunk at first,

00:02:00.078 --> 00:02:02.273
'cause of the black and white.

00:02:02.273 --> 00:02:03.777
It's a porcupine (laughs).

00:02:03.777 --> 00:02:05.523
- I know it's probably very
illegal, but I would definitely

00:02:05.523 --> 00:02:08.575
put one of these in my large zoo one day.

00:02:08.575 --> 00:02:12.847
- We're all pals, like, let's
go hang out and eat leaves.

00:02:12.847 --> 00:02:14.475
Salad, anyone?

00:02:14.475 --> 00:02:16.392
- You're my friend now.

00:02:20.005 --> 00:02:24.035
- It's just nature happening
on the table (laughs).

00:02:24.035 --> 00:02:25.545
And they're eatin' leaves.

00:02:25.545 --> 00:02:28.036
It's the cutest thing I've ever seen.

